yy-thunks provides linker import libraries rather than a normal CMake target.

Use find_package(yy-thunks CONFIG REQUIRED). With LLD, prepend
${YY_THUNKS_WIN7_X64_LIBRARY_DIR} with target_link_directories(BEFORE ...); with
MSVC link.exe, link ${YY_THUNKS_WIN7_X64_OBJECT} directly.
The package also exports ${YY_THUNKS_WIN7_X64_EXPORT_MAP} for PE import audits.
